<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Alcom 6-month net down 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Alcom 6-month net down 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		13.66	vs	 14.51</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     10.5	 vs	 11.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		 124.05	vs	132.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  13.08	vs	 13.84</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of company is Aluminium Company of Malaysia Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
